cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Mampok – Managing Multiple Projects on Kubernetes"
abstract: "Mampok deploys containerized bioinformatics tools (Cellxgene, Jupyter, RStudio, IGV, and more) on a Kubernetes cluster backed by S3-compatible object storage. Projects are described declaratively in Mamplans; Mampok handles S3 uploads, Kubernetes resource creation, pod readiness checks, and deployment lifecycle management."
